        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoseya sea gatmooda hiseada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Una biikta bwariinya gatmooda bwariiy ng'wasangaaschi nea gwahiseada, gawuurji gidabwariiyda NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli, eara gwayamiisa geat aseecheeka suuk ea bariinyeega mukaatajeega sabiibooda gajeami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geasheaysi geaw gatmooni aba shekeelaji damanamuut bea lapiya ea homeeri ea mushoota shayiiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayeeshi, “Gaywoosa gatmoodeanyu aba eawoojiga saang'a, nea ea maygudu hiseada, nea ea maygudu was gatmu sih nuut; ak eara aniini ea gichea dawuurji gil aba headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba diibiga Israeli gaygoobiida eawoojiga saang'a nea mandeawana sugoocheanda ghana siida haw, ak ea mayghoan ghoadayda lukghumajeega sigwariida, ea ng'udanga, ea naifeera ea sanaamu sisna geadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gaygwayamu geat diibiga Israeli gagaseada NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, ea Dawdi was sugoocheanda nyaawa; ng'ata gayghoang'eat gwasissa mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea miyindaanyi aba eawoojiga muudeanooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
